    "text": "Which of the following compounds are antiaromatic\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/q_c6lJzVVSaJku6DTZUAfjiohephEJALiadH9WGSpDs.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
